:''Not to be confused with [[Miyamoku Musashi (Special Cat)|Miyamoku Musashi]].''
'''Musashi Miyamoto''' is a [[:Category:Legend Rare Cats|Legend Rare Cat]] that can be obtained at an extremely low chance when playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Sengoku Wargods Vajiras (Gacha Event)|Sengoku Wargods Vajiras]] event. He was added in [[Version 8.0 Update|Version 8.0]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 13.5 Update|Version 13.5]] increases health and attack power, and gains [[Colossus Slayer]] along with [[Immune to Weaken|Immunity to Weaken]] and [[Immune to Slow|Slow]].

